# ── Rust ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/target/
**/target/
# Project-local Zig toolchain fetched by scripts/bootstrap-zig.*
/.zig/
# Note: Cargo.lock IS committed — ConMan ships as an application, not a library.

# ── Development docs (never tracked) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Specs, plans, task files, memos, design notes — local to the working copy.
docs/devel/

# ── Local secrets / dev data ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Never let real connection profiles, credentials, or dev databases be tracked.
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
.env
.env.*
*.local.toml
/secrets/

# ── Editors / IDEs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*~

# ── OS cruft ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── Scratch ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
/tmp/
/scratch/
